{"id":"98ea8403ba8386af","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-fep.md","title":"Finite Embedding Property","display":"df-fep — Finite Embedding Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-fep","aliases":["93-df-fep"],"display":"df-fep — Finite Embedding Property","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]","[[93-df-finite-algebra]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-fep"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-fep</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fep — Finite Embedding Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" href=\"?note=32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" title=\"93-df-finite-algebra\">93-df-finite-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is a similarity-type candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is a class candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li>A finite partial subalgebra is represented by a finite subset <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq A\">\\(P\\subseteq A\\)</span>; an operation value is required to be preserved exactly when it lies again in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}(-;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}(-;\\tau)\\)</span> are the finite-set, finite-algebra, and finite-embedding-property predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fep}\\vdash\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall P\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(P)\\to\\exists\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists e\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land e:P\\to|\\mathbf B|\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(e(x)=e(y)\\to x=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar p\\in P^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(f^{\\mathbf A}(\\bar p)\\in P\\to\ne(f^{\\mathbf A}(\\bar p))=f^{\\mathbf B}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(e,\\alpha(f),\\bar p)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fep}\\vdash\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall P\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(P)\\to\\exists\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists e\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land e:P\\to|\\mathbf B|\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(e(x)=e(y)\\to x=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar p\\in P^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(f^{\\mathbf A}(\\bar p)\\in P\\to\ne(f^{\\mathbf A}(\\bar p))=f^{\\mathbf B}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(e,\\alpha(f),\\bar p)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both “partial subalgebra” and “partial embedding” are expanded, so no natural-language predicates carry the logical content.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"32c4e6b205cc3cd8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$, $\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ are sourced from [[93-df-algebra]], [[93-df-homomorphism]], and [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$, $\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ are sourced from [[93-df-algebra]], [[93-df-homomorphism]], and [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$, $\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ are sourced from [[93-df-algebra]], [[93-df-homomorphism]], and [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}(-;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fep}\\vdash\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall P\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(P)\\to\\exists\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists e\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land e:P\\to|\\mathbf B|\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(e(x)=e(y)\\to x=y)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar p\\in P^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(f^{\\mathbf A}(\\bar p)\\in P\\to\ne(f^{\\mathbf A}(\\bar p))=f^{\\mathbf B}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(e,\\alpha(f),\\bar p)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1885,"backlinks":[{"id":"a8c17e59e6ab2d52","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-fep]] and [[93-df-wep]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-fep]]"}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","f10e7e3251fa7f7d","32c4e6b205cc3cd8","e30eac382dc7d1a7","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3"]}